# QtClient 构建产物与 IDE 缓存
# 设计意图：命令行(cmake+ninja)与 Qt Creator 均会各自生成构建目录，
# 统一用通配忽略，避免编译中间件、moc/rcc 生成物进入版本库。

# ── CMake / Ninja / Make 构建目录 ──
build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
compile_commands.json

# ── Qt Creator 个人/会话配置（不随工程共享）──
*.pro.user
*.pro.user.*
*.cmake.user
CMakeLists.txt.user*

# ── Qt 元编译 / 资源生成物 ──
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
qrc_*.cpp
ui_*.h
*.autogen/
*_autogen/

# ── 编译中间件与链接产物 ──
*.o
*.obj
*.mo
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.loc
*.tab*
*.sim
*.swo
*.swp
Makefile

# ── 日志与临时文件 ──
*.log
*.tmp
tmp/
